WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.880
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:00.880 --> 00:00:03.005
MICHAELA KEPLINGER-MITTERLEHNER:
Nowadays, everyone

00:00:03.005 --> 00:00:05.330
is searching for
information online.

00:00:05.330 --> 00:00:08.810
Raiffeisen is the largest
banking group in Austria,

00:00:08.810 --> 00:00:11.950
so we need to provide our
customers with accurate

00:00:11.950 --> 00:00:13.427
information quickly.

00:00:13.427 --> 00:00:15.010
WALTER MOESENBACHER:
Our internal data

00:00:15.010 --> 00:00:16.360
was poorly managed.

00:00:16.360 --> 00:00:18.100
And so we had a bad
online presence,

00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:19.690
especially in Google Maps.

00:00:19.690 --> 00:00:22.460
People couldn't find the right
addresses of our branches,

00:00:22.460 --> 00:00:23.890
the right phone numbers.

00:00:23.890 --> 00:00:27.200
We used Google Maps APIs to
help us consolidate and optimize

00:00:27.200 --> 00:00:29.170
our online information.

00:00:29.170 --> 00:00:31.510
Because our data was
up-to-date, customers

00:00:31.510 --> 00:00:34.090
found what they were looking
for quickly and easily.

00:00:34.090 --> 00:00:36.670
We see the actual
results immediately.

00:00:36.670 --> 00:00:41.330
Our final optimization was 20%
with 60% increased conversion

00:00:41.330 --> 00:00:42.970
in the first year.

00:00:42.970 --> 00:00:45.511
MICHAELA KEPLINGER-MITTERLEHNER:
With the help of Google Maps

00:00:45.511 --> 00:00:48.040
APIs, we are able to
offer our customers a much

00:00:48.040 --> 00:00:49.660
better online experience.

00:00:49.660 --> 00:00:53.010
[MUSIC PLAYING]

